repository-code: "https://github.com/Alqudimi/AraNorm"
abstract: >-
  AraNorm is a production-grade, dependency-free Arabic text
  normalization library for Python. It unifies orthographic
  normalization, dialect identification and conversion, Arabizi
  transliteration, an advanced stop-word engine covering eight Arabic
  dialects, and more than 45 linguistic analyzers behind a single,
  typed, thoroughly tested API. It also ships a 43-command CLI, an
  optional HTTP normalization service, resumable streaming sessions
  with atomic checkpoints, and integrations with pandas,
  scikit-learn, spaCy, NLTK, and HuggingFace.
